#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/servo-guide/usage-tips.rst:4
msgid "Servo Usage Tips"
msgstr "舵机使用技巧"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/servo-guide/usage-tips.rst:6
msgid "Below are some tips on using servos in FTC\\ |reg|."
msgstr "下面是在 FTC\\ |reg| 中使用舵机的一些提示。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/servo-guide/usage-tips.rst:8
msgid ""
"Do not backdrive :term:`servos <Servo>`. Forcibly rotating a powered "
":term:`servo <Servo>` away from its position risks damaging the internal "
":term:`gears <Gear>`."
msgstr ""
"请勿反向驱动 :term:`舵机 <Servo>` 。强行将电动 :term:`舵机 <Servo>` 从其位置上旋转可能会损坏舵机内部的 "
":term:`齿轮 <Gear>` 。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/servo-guide/usage-tips.rst:9
msgid ""
"Pay attention to a servo's travel range! The default 600-2400 range of the "
"FTC control system when selecting the \"Servo\" configuration can make it "
"appear that popular servos like the goBILDA Dual Mode Servos and REV Smart "
"Robot Servos have less range than advertised. Make sure you select the "
"\"Full Range Servo\" configuration instead to get the full 500-2500 range."
msgstr ""
"请注意舵机的行程范围！在FTC控制系统中选择“Servo”配置时，默认的600-2400行程范围可能会导致诸如goBILDA双模式舵机和REV智能机器人舵机等热门舵机看似其行程范围小于宣传值。"
" 请务必改选“全行程伺服”配置，以获得完整的 500-2500 行程范围。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/servo-guide/usage-tips.rst:10
msgid ""
":term:`Servo` wires usually are black-red-white or black-red-yellow. "
"Matching the colors is an easy way to check if the servo is plugged in "
"correctly. Most :term:`servo <Servo>` connectors provide no protection from "
"plugging them the wrong way: if you rotate it 180 degrees, it will still fit"
" - but the :term:`servo <Servo>` would not work. (It shouldn't be damaged, "
"though.) Thus, if your :term:`servo <Servo>` is not working, first check if "
"they are plugged in correctly. Then check it again."
msgstr ""
":term:`Servo` 的线通常为黑-红-白或黑-红-黄。 通过颜色匹配是检查伺服电机是否插接正确的一种简单方法。大多数 "
":term:`舵机<Servo>` 连接器没有防反插保护：即使将连接器旋转 180 度，它仍然能插上——但 :term:`舵机<Servo>` "
"将无法工作。 （不过，这不应导致其损坏。）因此，如果你的 :term:`舵机<Servo>` 无法工作，请先检查是否插接正确。然后再次检查一遍。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/servo-guide/usage-tips.rst:12
msgid ""
"When using :term:`servo <Servo>` wire extensions, use `retaining clips "
"<https://www.gobilda.com/servo-connector-clip-yellow-6-pack/>`_ to prevent "
"the connection from coming apart when someone pulls on the wire. "
"Alternatively, electrical tape will work in a pinch."
msgstr ""
"在使用 :term:`舵机 <Servo>` 延长线时，请使用 `固定夹 <https://www.gobilda.com/servo-"
"connector-clip-yellow-6-pack/>`_ ，以防止在有人拉扯电线时连接脱开。或者，在紧要关头也可以使用电工胶带。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/servo-guide/usage-tips.rst:13
msgid ""
"Some vendors sell versions of the 3-pin female connector with retaining "
"clips built-in. BackBayRC on Amazon sells pre-made `servo extension wires "
"with locking connectors <https://www.amazon.com/BackBayRC-Extension-Strands-"
"Vehicles-bikes/dp/B0CXR2YBS4/>`_; and Ferra Components sells both `pre-made "
"servo extension wires with locking connectors "
"<https://ferracomponents.com/products/20awg-locking-servo-wire>`_, and "
"`packs of locking connectors you can crimp yourself "
"<https://ferracomponents.com/products/servo-locking-connector>`_."
msgstr ""
"有些供应商销售的3针母头连接器带有内置锁扣。 亚马逊上的 BackBayRC 销售预制的 `带锁定连接器的舵机延长线 "
"<https://www.amazon.com/BackBayRC-Extension-Strands-Vehicles-"
"bikes/dp/B0CXR2YBS4/>`_；而 Ferra Components 则同时销售 `带锁定连接器的预制舵机延长线 "
"<https://ferracomponents.com/products/20awg-locking-servo-wire>`_，以及 "
"`可自行压接的锁定连接器套装 <https://ferracomponents.com/products/servo-locking-"
"connector>`_。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/servo-guide/usage-tips.rst:14
msgid ""
"Do not use bare socket head screws to attach :term:`servos <Servo>` - when "
"tightened, they will damage the plastic. Use button head screws or socket "
"heads with a washer."
msgstr ""
"请勿使用只用光的杯头内六角螺丝来固定 :term:`舵机<Servo>`——拧紧时，它们会损坏塑料部件。请使用圆头螺丝或带垫圈的杯头内六角螺丝。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/servo-guide/usage-tips.rst:15
msgid ""
":term:`Servos <Servo>` break very easily when subjected to lateral loads or "
"bending of the :term:`shaft <Shaft>`. For example, if you mount an arm or a "
"claw directly on the :term:`servo <Servo>` without any additional "
"precautions, it is very likely that you will break the :term:`servo <Servo>`"
" first time you drive into the wall with the arm extended (and this will "
"inevitably happen)."
msgstr ""
":term:`舵机 <Servo>` 在承受横向负载或 :term:`轴 <Shaft>` 弯曲时很容易断裂。例如，如果不采取任何额外的预防措施，直接在"
" :term:`舵机 <Servo>` 上安装机械臂或机械爪，很可能在机械臂伸长后第一次撞墙时就会折断 :term:`舵机 <Servo>` "
"（这种情况不可避免地会发生）。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/servo-guide/usage-tips.rst:17
msgid ""
"To avoid that, use additional supports. The easiest way to do it is by using"
" `ServoBlocks from goBILDA <https://www.gobilda.com/servoblocks>`_. "
":term:`ServoBlocks` act as exoskeletons for the :term:`servo <Servo>`, "
"providing additional support. They pay for themselves, since they help "
"protect your servos from getting damaged. Additionally, REV offers the "
"inside and outside channel :term:`servo <Servo>` bracket, which when paired "
"with the aluminum servo :term:`shaft <Shaft>` adapter and :term:`bearing "
"<Ball Bearing>` assembly, fulfills the same function."
msgstr ""
"为避免这种情况，请使用额外的支撑件。最简单的方法是使用 goBILDA 的 `ServoBlocks "
"<https://www.gobilda.com/servoblocks>`_。:term:`ServoBlocks` 相当于 :term:`舵机 "
"<Servo>` 的外骨骼，能提供额外的支撑。 它们物有所值，因为能有效保护您的舵机免受损坏。此外，REV 还提供内侧和外侧通道的 :term:`舵机 "
"<Servo>` 支架，当与铝制 :term:`舵机轴 <Shaft>` 适配器和 :term:`轴承 <Ball Bearing>` "
"组件搭配使用时，也能实现相同的功能。"

