#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/servo-guide/usage-tips.rst:29
msgid ""
"Linkage example, courtesy of team 4137 Islandbots. A goBILDA flat beam is "
"used as the link."
msgstr "连杆示例，由 4137 Islandbots 队伍提供。使用 goBILDA 平梁作为连接装置。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/servo-guide/usage-tips.rst:31
msgid ""
"If you need more power, use a `REV Servo Hub "
"<https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1855/>`_ or `goBILDA 6V Servo Power "
"Injector <https://www.gobilda.com/6v-servo-power-"
"injector-6-channel-8-15v-input/>`_. **This is important for servos under "
"high load conditions.**"
msgstr ""
"如果需要更大的功率，请使用 `REV 舵机集线器 <https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1855/>`_ 或 "
"`goBILDA 6V 舵机电源注入器 <https://www.gobilda.com/6v-servo-power-"
"injector-6-channel-8-15v-input/>`_ 。**这对处于高负载状态下的舵机尤为重要。**"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/servo-guide/usage-tips.rst:33
msgid "Term"
msgstr "术语"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/servo-guide/usage-tips.rst:36
msgid "Servo Power Module"
msgstr "舵机电源模块"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/servo-guide/usage-tips.rst:38
msgid ""
"A Servo Power Module (SPM) is a device made by REV Robotics that boosts the "
"voltage that the Expansion Hub provides to a :term:`servo <Servo>`. The "
"Control/Expansion Hub's output for servos is 5V at 6 amps, and the SPM "
"boosts the voltage to 6V and up to 15amps."
msgstr ""
"舵机电源模块（SPM）是由 REV Robotics 生产的一种设备，用于将扩展集线器为 :term:`舵机 <Servo>` 提供的电压升压。 "
"控制/扩展集线器为舵机提供的输出电压为5V，电流为6安培，而SPM可将电压提升至6V，电流最高可达15安培。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/servo-guide/usage-tips.rst:41
msgid ""
"The Servo Power Module has a tendency to fail spectacularly, burning out the"
" SPM, and sometimes the Control/Expansion Hub it is plugged into.  Teams "
"shouold use the newer REV Servo Hub or goBILDA Servo Power Injector instead."
msgstr ""
"舵机电源模块（Servo Power "
"Module）容易发生严重故障，不仅会导致SPM本身烧毁，有时还会烧毁其所连接的控制/扩展集线器。各团队应改用较新的 REV Servo Hub "
"或goBILDA Servo Power Injector 。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/servo-guide/usage-tips.rst-1
msgid "A REV Robotics Servo Power Module"
msgstr "REV 机器人舵机电源模块"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/servo-guide/usage-tips.rst:46
msgid "Servo Hub"
msgstr "Servo Hub"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/servo-guide/usage-tips.rst:48
msgid ""
"A Servo Hub is a device made by REV Robotics that is a controller like the "
"Expansion Hub, but only controls servos. The Control/Expansion Hub's output "
"for servos is 5V at 6 amps, but the Servo Hub's output for servos is 6V and "
"up to 15amps."
msgstr ""
"舵机集线器（Servo Hub）是由REV Robotics公司生产的一种设备，它与扩展集线器（Expansion "
"Hub）类似，都属于控制器，但仅用于控制舵机。控制/扩展集线器（Control/Expansion "
"Hub）为舵机提供的输出电压为5V，电流为6安培；而舵机集线器（Servo Hub）为舵机提供的输出电压为6V，电流最高可达15安培。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/servo-guide/usage-tips.rst:51
msgid ""
"The Servo Hub can make wiring significantly easier in certain circumstances."
" For example, if you have an arm on a long extension that has 4 servos on "
"it, you can run just the power wire and the data wire to a Servo Hub on the "
"end of the arm, rather than running 4 servo extension cables the entire "
"length."
msgstr ""
"在某些情况下，舵机集线器可以大大简化布线工作。例如，如果您的机械臂上安装了一个长延伸臂，且该延伸臂上装有4个伺服电机，您只需将电源线和数据线连接到延伸臂末端的伺服集线器上，而无需沿整个延伸臂铺设4根舵机延长线。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/servo-guide/usage-tips.rst:56
msgid "goBILDA 6V Servo Power Injector"
msgstr "goBILDA 6V Servo Power Injector"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/servo-guide/usage-tips.rst:58
msgid ""
"A Servo Power Injector (SPI) is a device made by goBILDA that boosts the "
"voltage that the Expansion Hub provides to a :term:`servo <Servo>`. The "
"Control/Expansion Hub's output for servos is 5V at 6 amps, and the SPI "
"boosts the voltage to 6V and up to 24 amps total output. It works similarly "
"to the original REV Servo Power Module, but with significant improvements to"
" maximum output power and overcurrent handling to prevent failure."
msgstr ""
"舵机电源注入器（Servo Power Injector）是由 goBILDA 制造的一种设备，用于将扩展集线器为 :term:`舵机 <Servo>`"
" 提供的电压进行升压。 "
"控制/扩展集线器为舵机提供的输出电压为5V、电流为6安培，而SPI可将电压提升至6V，总输出电流最高可达24安培。其工作原理与原版REV舵机电源模块类似，但在最大输出功率和过流保护方面进行了显著改进，以防止设备故障。"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/power-and-electronics/servo-guide/usage-tips.rst-1
msgid "A goBILDA 6V Servo Power Injector"
msgstr "goBILDA 6V Servo Power Injector"
